{
  "id": "DEU.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Obwijukiro 10",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu kanya ako Omukama akangambira ati, ‘Obaije embengo ibili z'amabare ezilikushusha eza mbere, oije owange aha ibanga, okore n'Esanduku y'embaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyija kuhandika aha mbengo ebigambo ebibaire bili aha mbengo eza mbere ez'oyasire, mara oziteke omu sanduku.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo nkakora Esanduku y'omuti gw'omushita, mbaija n'embengo ibili z'amabare nk'eza mbere, ntemba nazo aha ibanga nzikwasire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahandika aha mbengo ezo nk'okwo yabaire ahandikireho elya mbere, emihango ikumi eyo yabagambiire aha ibanga ayemire omu muliro kiro ekyo mwahurura ashuba agimpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nkwata omuhanda nsongoka eibanga, nteka embengo omu sanduku eyo nabaire nkozire, na mbwenu nimwo zili nk'okwo Omukama yampangiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Abaisiraeli baruga aha maziba ga Beneyakani bagya Mosera. Niho Aroni yagwire, kandi niho yaziikirwe. Omutabani Eleazari aba mukuhani amusikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruga Mosera bagya Gudigoda; kuruga Gudigoda bagya Yotibata ensi y'obwiga bw'amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebyo Omukama aronda oruganda rwa Levi kushutura Esanduku y'Omukama y'Endagano, kuba abakuhani bakamukolera n'okuha abantu omugisha omw'ibaralye kugoba kir'eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo oruganda rwa Levi tirugira mugabo anga busika nka nganda zindi. Omukama niwe busika bwabo, nk'okwo Omukama Ruhanga wanyu yabaraganisize.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha ibanga nkamarayo ebiro makumi ganai nyemishana n'ekiro nk'orwa mbere. Mara n'elyo Omukama akampulira; yaikiliza kutabasilikya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akangambira ati, ‘Imuka ogendelere n'orugendo rwawe oyebembeire abantu abo bagye batahe omu nsi eyo nanahiliire baishebo okwo ndigibaha, bagilye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mbwenu aho Baisiraeli, Omukama Ruhanga wanyu nabenzaki? Kakutali kumutina, kukora eby'alikwenda, kumugonza, kumukolera n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'omwoyo gwanyu gwona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukwata emihango n'ebiragirobye ebyo ndikubaragira kir'eki mukagira emilembe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, eiguru lyona n'ensi hamoi n'ebigilimu biba by'Omukama Ruhanga wawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai akagonza bashwenkuru, yaronda baijukuru babo, inywe nywenene yabaronka omu mahanga gona, nk'okwo bili na kir'eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo muhulire Omukama mulekere kugumangana emitima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wanyu ni Ruhanga akira baruhanga, Mukama atwara abakama, mukuru w'amani mara w'okutinwa, atagira kigonzi, anga kulya rushwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramura enfuuzi n'entumbwakazi omu mazima; kandi agonza omufuruki namuha ekyakulya n'ekijwaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mugonze abafuruki enshonga nainywe mukama muli bafuruki omu nsi ya Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otine Omukama Ruhanga wawe, omukolere, omugumeho, mara obe niwe oyenahira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwe kisingizo kyawe, niwe Ruhanga wawe ayakukoleire ebintu ebi by'amani mara ebilikutinisa ebyo wayeboneire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashwenkurw'inywe bakagya Misiri bali bantu nshanju; mbwenu leba Omukama Ruhanga wanyu yabakanyisize nk'enyanyinyi z'aha iguru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
